#### 7. Sensitive Equality (testsmells.org — core smell)

**Test:** `GetOrderSummary_ReturnsFormattedString` (line 135)
**Problem:** Compares via `.ToString()` — any formatting change (locale, currency symbol, spacing) breaks the test.

```csharp
// SMELLY
Assert.AreEqual("Order ORD-001: 1 item(s), Total: $99.99", summary.ToString());
```

**Fix:** Assert on the semantic properties of the summary object:

```csharp
Assert.AreEqual("ORD-001", summary.OrderId);
