#### 9. Assertion Roulette (testsmells.org — extended smell)

**Test:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` (lines 84-86)
**Problem:** Three assertions with no message parameters. When one fails, the runner reports only the expected/actual mismatch with no label.

```csharp
